  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">FHS/IFS - China in a New Era</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project main aim is to promote China&#x2019;s continued economic development and welfare through an analysis of how the changing security situation in Asia affect the country&#x2019;s development. In this context, the project will also analyze the possibility of confidence-building measures (CBMs) between China and USA providing policy input for a potential de-escalation of the tension, including the fields of trade and economy, between the two powers.</narrative>
  </description>
